# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied into out/_redirects by `next build`.
# Format: <from> <to> [status]. Evaluated top to bottom, first match wins.
#
# Do NOT add a catch-all splat here. Client-side navigation fetches the RSC
# payloads at /mk/uslugi.txt and friends; a rule that swallowed those would
# turn every in-app link into a full page reload.

# The site is Macedonian-only and there is no page at the root. This replaces
# the redirect("/mk") that a static export cannot honour — without it, `/`
# would serve a blank 200.
#
# Deliberately 302 for now: the cutover from the old site is reversible while
# this is temporary. Once a week of live traffic looks right, change it to 301
# so the ranking signals consolidate onto /mk permanently.
/                       /mk                     302

